any":"Adinteg","companyLogo":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/customer-logos/adinteg.svg","website":"http://adinteg.com","quoteOwner":{"name":"Max Bodnar","title":"Founder & Head of Technical Department","picture":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/customer-logos/adinteg.svg"},"quotes":{"default":["We are using geolocation data to target ads to geographic locations and have been working with another IP data provider for some years. Over time, I have received complaints from users about not accurately pinpointing their locations which is why we decided to test IPinfo.io.","We chose to work with IPinfo.io\'s Geolocation datasets because of their high accuracy in pinpointing users\' location and easy database update. They also had excellent user support and offered a fair price."]}},"0x00sec":{"company":"0x00sec","website":"https://0x00sec.org/","companyLogo":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/customer-logos/0x00sec.png","quoteOwner":{"name":"Ben Bidmead","title":"Founder / President","picture":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/testimonials/ben-bidmead.jpeg"},"quotes":{"default":["I’ve said it once and I’ll say it again, I am a HUGE advocate for @ipinfo and if you’re doing threat intel, pentesting or bug bounty or any security domain it is insanely invaluable."]}},"benDowling":{"company":"IPinfo","website":"https://www.ipinfo.io/","quoteOwner":{"name":"Ben Dowling","title":"Founder & CEO","picture":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/team/ben.jpg"},"quotes":{"howWeWork":["By eliminating the physical office altogether, I wanted to open the door for talented people to join the team without being limited by geographic location. That\'s how we\'ve been able to find the best team members for each position."],"dataFeatures":["There are two main things we\'re always doing at IPinfo. The first is making sure that our data is great quality. That will be a project that will probably last forever. The other piece is how we make it easy for people to access that data."]}},"betterPlaceForests":{"company":"Better Place Forests","website":"https://www.betterplaceforests.com/","companyLogo":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/customer-logos/betterplaceforests.svg","quoteOwner":{"name":"Navneet Goel","title":"Head of Software Operations","picture":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/testimonials/navneet-goel.jpeg"},"quotes":{"default":["We\'ve been using IPinfo.io Snowflake integration for about a year. It\'s extremely helpful to get the data the way we need it. We are successfully enriching both ipv4 and ipv6 addresses using the IPinfo location database in Snowflake. On top of that, we get timely technical support and help with queries and data. 5 stars!"]}},"bupa":{"company":"Bupa","website":"https://www.bupa.com/","companyLogo":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/customer-logos/bupa-white.svg","quoteOwner":{"name":"Anthony Jaggs","title":"Digital Product Owner","picture":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/testimonials/anthony-jaggs.jpeg"},"quotes":{"value":["IPinfo enables us to demonstrate the value that Bupa.com has in the global purchasing journey. Without it, the website wouldn\'t be able to fulfill this important role."],"support":["From the start, the IPinfo team has valued our contribution. The customer service is great—they respond to requests and support tickets and we have an excellent relationship with our account manager."],"geolocation":["Before IPinfo, we didn\'t personalize the site. If people landed on it, they would have to identify which country they were coming from, or the country wouldn\'t even be displayed. The visitor often ended up navigating through the site or going back to Google to find what they were looking for. This resulted in an unsatisfactory experience for our users."],"useCase":["IPinfo\'s API is a core part of our website. As a result, we have created a bespoke solution that integrates with our CMS so we can manage the geolocation capability to suit our needs."]}},"cinesend":{"company":"CineSend","website":"https://cinesend.com/","companyLogo":"","quoteOwner":{"name":"D\'Arcy Rail-Ip","title":"Lead Developer","picture":""},"quotes":{"default":["Getting up and running with the APIs was super straightforward. It’s one API call, send an IP address with your token token, get the info."]}},"clearbit":{"company":"Clearbit","website":"https://clearbit.com/","companyLogo":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/customer-logos/clearbit-white.svg","quoteOwner":{"name":"Alex Maccaw","title":"CEO","picture":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/testimonials/alex-maccaw.jpeg"},"quotes":{"default":["IPinfo has been a great service for us, highly recommended!"]}},"curamCare":{"company":"Curam Care","website":"https://www.curamcare.com/","companyLogo":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/customer-logos/curam.svg","quoteOwner":{"name":"Benjamin Weatherall","title":"Director"},"quotes":{"useCase":["We predominantly use it for localized forms of searching for users to find individual home carers in our database."]}},"cytoplan":{"company":"Cytoplan","website":"https://www.cytoplan.co.uk/","quoteOwner":{"name":"Hans-Ulrich Kuhn","title":"Head of Web Development & IT","picture":""},"quotes":{"default":["We used MaxMind before, but the IPinfo’s API was much better."]}},"danielMiessler":{"company":"","website":"https://twitter.com/DanielMiessler","quoteOwner":{"name":"Daniel Miessler","title":"Cybersecurity Expert and Podcaster","picture":""},"quotes":{"default":["IPinfo.io is key part of my entire automation stack. I\'ve been really impressed with the quality of the data"]}},"dreamdata":{"company":"Dreamdata","website":"https://dreamdata.io/","companyLogo":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/customer-logos/dreamdata.svg","quoteOwner":{"name":"Ole Dallerup","title":"CTO & Co-founder","picture":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/testimonials/ole-dallerup.jpeg"},"quotes":{"needs":["We needed a vendor to provide IP data at a reasonable price, because this is not our primary functionality. We use IPInfo to help our customers (B2B companies) understand their customers and map out the customer journey, by identifying the country and city, and reverse lookups of account activities."],"raw-data":["The ability to give raw data is one of the strongest features of IPInfo."]}},"fastly":{"company":"Fastly","website":"https://www.fastly.com/","companyLogo":"","quoteOwner":{"name":"David Belson","title":"Senior Director, Data Insights","picture":""},"quotes":{"default":["IP geolocation is part art, part science -- Ben Dowling and the IPinfo team nail both!"]}},"findhotel":{"company":"FindHotel","website":"https://www.findhotel.net/","companyLogo":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/customer-logos/findhotel.svg","quoteOwner":{"name":"German Gomez-Herrero","title":"CTO","picture":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/testimonials/german-gomez-herrero.jpeg"},"quotes":{"default":["The private IP feature is most important for us to identify whether an IP is a TOR exit node, a VPN, or a proxy, since these are rarely used by regular customers."]}},"greynoise":{"company":"GreyNoise","website":"https://www.greynoise.io/","companyLogo":"","quoteOwner":{"name":"Andrew Morris","title":"Founder & Chief Architect","picture":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/testimonials/andrew-morris.jpeg"},"quotes":{"value":["IPInfo is absolutely essential to our business. The data is rock solid, the API is dead simple, and the price is unbeatable. I constantly recommend it to all of my friends in the industry."],"features":["IPinfo has a great team, responsive API, affordable prices, and unbeatable uptime—every feature we could ask for. I recommend it to all of my friends in the industry. Side by side with other providers, it cannot be beaten."],"api":["It’s fast, simple, and accurate. The API is well-documented and it has good support for bindings of different languages."],"asn":["We needed to further contextualize Internet scanners, crawlers, and bots. Origin networks, data 