 companies are using our service."]}},"oort":{"company":"Oort","website":"https://oort.io","quoteOwner":{"name":"Nicolas Dard","title":"VP of Product, Oort"},"quotes":{"default":["Our customers are trying to understand when accounts are performing suspicious activities. They need to determine if the user identity is who they’re claiming to be. IP address data is a really good indication of that."],"geolocation":["Geolocation is a really important point for our customers. When an account logs on and is involved in suspicious activities that look like security risks, it’s very important to be able to identify where that person normally logs on versus the location of the suspicious activity. It’s a vital piece of context to make decisions on how to respond to that particular area of risk."]}},"panther":{"company":"Panther","website":"https://panther.com/","companyLogo":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/customer-logos/panther.svg","quoteOwner":{"name":"Joren McReynolds","title":"SVP of Engineering, Product & Design","picture":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/testimonials/joren-mcreynolds.png"},"quotes":{"default":["As a cloud-native SIEM that provides highly-scalable, real-time threat detection, Panther needs effective enrichment to make sure customers get the context they need fast. As a fellow Snowflake partner, IPinfo was an ideal choice for seamless alert enrichment - quickly adding the geolocation and ASN context our customers need to tune detections and accelerate triage."]}},"personalCapital":{"company":"Personal Capital","website":"https://www.personalcapital.com/","companyLogo":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/customer-logos/personalcapital.svg","quoteOwner":{"name":"Maxime Rousseau","title":"Chief Information Security Officer","picture":"https://cdn.ipinfo.io/static/images/testimonials/maxime-rousseau.jpeg"},"quotes":{"default":["As part of our security operations & automations we have multiple use cases for doing IP data enrichment programmatically